pcbkit 1

// PCBKit's mark alone (the chip, its pin-1 dot cut out: brand/logo/mark-mono.svg).
// Cut from PCBKIT_LOGO.pcbkit (the same polygons, scaled 2x and centred): 12.8 x 12.8 mm.
// A part with nothing to solder.

